# Astro Portfolio Architecture

This is an Astro-based portfolio website with photography and blog sections.

## Project Structure
- **Components**: Located in [src/components/](mdc:src/components) - reusable Astro components
- **Content Collections**: Defined in [src/content/config.ts](mdc:src/content/config.ts)
  - `blog`: Markdown content for blog posts in [src/content/blog/](mdc:src/content/blog)
  - `photography`: YAML data files with image references in [src/content/photography/](mdc:src/content/photography)
- **Pages**: Dynamic routes in [src/pages/](mdc:src/pages) following Astro's file-based routing
- **Layouts**: Page layouts in [src/layouts/](mdc:src/layouts)
- **Utils**: Helper functions in [src/utils/](mdc:src/utils)

## Content Management
- Blog posts: Markdown files with frontmatter
- Photos: YAML files paired with JPG images, referenced by date-based IDs
- All content is managed through Astro Content Collections for type safety
